<title>GERMANY: Bewag nine-month pretax profit eases.</title>
<headline>Bewag nine-month pretax profit eases.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     359     vs 372</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,158   vs 3,326</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German utilities group is Bewag AG. The company attributed the fall in profit to falling electricity prices and lower sales volumes, but noted that profit rose by 155 million marks if the effect of extraordinary writedowns was stripped out.</p>
</text>
